  "title": "Deep-Fried Morel Mushrooms",
  "description": "These deep-fried morel mushrooms are savory, crispy, and easy to make. Try this crowd-pleasing, mouthwatering, umami-filled appetizer for your next party.",
  "authors": [
    "Peggianne"
  ],
